# The deployment's outbound client registration at the compliance reviewer (extract-compliance-plugin): OAuth 2.0
# client credentials are issued per authorization server — per reviewer — so they are the deployment's A2A
# configuration, given to the api whether the plugin is in use or not (a plugin's fragment never changes the api's
# environment, so switching it needs only a restart). The assistant consults as a system, never as a user.
Compliance__BaseUrl=${COMPLIANCE_BASE_URL:-http://lb/compliance}
Compliance__ClientId=maf-lab-assistant
Compliance__ClientSecret=${COMPLIANCE_CLIENT_SECRET:-assistant-dev-secret}
